    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Grifford Academy </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enigmatic world of Grifford Academy, a mesmerizing coming-of-age RPG where magic, monsters, and teenage turmoil collide. Join Erika, Viva, and Cap as they navigate the mystical book realm of Caldria, uncovering secrets and battling sinister forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/aa0609f0713d81dca5c0e5d2eea2e799.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/aa0609f0713d81dca5c0e5d2eea2e799.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/aa0609f0713d81dca5c0e5d2eea2e799.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Uncover secrets in the mystical realm of Caldria</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive World-Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the beautifully crafted realm of Caldria, filled with menacing creatures and otherworldly discoveries. Equip your squad, level up, and immerse yourself in strategic turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/4c375fb4ed24a480ee2e14330f8827a1.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/4c375fb4ed24a480ee2e14330f8827a1.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/4c375fb4ed24a480ee2e14330f8827a1.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your characters through personal challenges and watch them evolve based on your decisions. Every choice matters, influencing the story and the characters' development in unexpected ways. Engage with a unique dialogue flow that allows you to connect with the characters and their journey at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/a14805373c0f3a55d8acbf0beaf09eb5.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/a14805373c0f3a55d8acbf0beaf09eb5.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/a14805373c0f3a55d8acbf0beaf09eb5.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your squad, level up, and immerse yourself in strategic turn-based combat. Grifford Academy offers both Story Mode for a relaxed experience and Strategy Mode for those seeking a challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/40ae179ec768f896ce64271d807f53ea.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/40ae179ec768f896ce64271d807f53ea.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/40ae179ec768f896ce64271d807f53ea.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to a journey where heart meets strategy and every battle counts.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Grifford Academy </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enigmatic world of Grifford Academy, a mesmerizing coming-of-age RPG where magic, monsters, and teenage turmoil collide. Join Erika, Viva, and Cap as they navigate the mystical book realm of Caldria, uncovering secrets and battling sinister forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/aa0609f0713d81dca5c0e5d2eea2e799.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/aa0609f0713d81dca5c0e5d2eea2e799.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/aa0609f0713d81dca5c0e5d2eea2e799.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Uncover secrets in the mystical realm of Caldria</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive World-Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the beautifully crafted realm of Caldria, filled with menacing creatures and otherworldly discoveries. Equip your squad, level up, and immerse yourself in strategic turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/4c375fb4ed24a480ee2e14330f8827a1.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/4c375fb4ed24a480ee2e14330f8827a1.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/4c375fb4ed24a480ee2e14330f8827a1.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your characters through personal challenges and watch them evolve based on your decisions. Every choice matters, influencing the story and the characters' development in unexpected ways. Engage with a unique dialogue flow that allows you to connect with the characters and their journey at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/a14805373c0f3a55d8acbf0beaf09eb5.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/a14805373c0f3a55d8acbf0beaf09eb5.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/a14805373c0f3a55d8acbf0beaf09eb5.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your squad, level up, and immerse yourself in strategic turn-based combat. Grifford Academy offers both Story Mode for a relaxed experience and Strategy Mode for those seeking a challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/40ae179ec768f896ce64271d807f53ea.poster.avif?t=1750870807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/40ae179ec768f896ce64271d807f53ea.webm?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445780/extras/40ae179ec768f896ce64271d807f53ea.mp4?t=1750870807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to a journey where heart meets strategy and every battle counts.</strong></h2>",
